---
// Testimonials.astro - Redesigned to build trust and credibility
---

<section
  class="relative py-24 lg:py-32 bg-gradient-to-b from-neutral-50 to-white overflow-hidden"
  id="testimonials"
>
  <!-- Decorative background -->
  <div
    class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-100/40 to-orange-100/30 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-50"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Section header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16">
      <p
        class="text-sm font-semibold text-amber-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3"
      >
        Testimonials
      </p>
      <h2
        class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-neutral-900 leading-tight mb-6"
      >
        Trusted by teammates
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
        What colleagues and collaborators say about working with me on real
        projects.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Testimonials Grid -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
      <!-- Testimonial 1 -->
      <div
        class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-neutral-200 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300"
      >
        <!-- Quote icon -->
        <div
          class="w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500 to-orange-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
        >
          <svg
            class="w-5 h-5 text-white"
            fill="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          >
            <path
              d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h3.983v10h-9.983z"
            ></path>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <blockquote class="text-neutral-700 text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
          "Jake consistently delivers high-quality code ahead of schedule. His
          attention to detail and thorough testing make code reviews
          straightforward. He's the kind of developer every team wants."
        </blockquote>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-neutral-100">
          <div
            class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-indigo-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-md"
          >
            <span class="text-white font-bold text-sm">RK</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-semibold text-neutral-900">Rachel Kim</div>
            <p class="text-neutral-600 text-sm">Senior Software Engineer</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 2 -->
      <div
        class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-neutral-200 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300"
      >
        <!-- Quote icon -->
        <div
          class="w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-pink-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
        >
          <svg
            class="w-5 h-5 text-white"
            fill="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          >
            <path
              d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h3.983v10h-9.983z"
            ></path>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <blockquote class="text-neutral-700 text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
          "What sets Jake apart is his ability to translate ambiguous
          requirements into solid technical solutions. He asks smart questions
          and builds exactly what's needed—no wasted effort."
        </blockquote>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-neutral-100">
          <div
            class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500 to-teal-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-md"
          >
            <span class="text-white font-bold text-sm">DM</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-semibold text-neutral-900">David Martinez</div>
            <p class="text-neutral-600 text-sm">Product Manager</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 3 -->
      <div
        class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-neutral-200 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1"
      >
        <!-- Quote icon -->
        <div
          class="w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 to-purple-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
        >
          <svg
            class="w-5 h-5 text-white"
            fill="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          >
            <path
              d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h3.983v10h-9.983z"
            ></path>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <blockquote class="text-neutral-700 text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
          "Jake thinks beyond just writing code—he considers the entire user
          experience. His applications are polished, performant, and solve real
          problems. A true professional."
        </blockquote>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-neutral-100">
          <div
            class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-500 to-red-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-md"
          >
            <span class="text-white font-bold text-sm">SL</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-semibold text-neutral-900">Sarah Lopez</div>
            <p class="text-neutral-600 text-sm">UX Designer</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Trust indicators -->
    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 py-12 border-y border-neutral-200 mb-16"
    >
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-2">5+</div>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 text-sm">Years Experience</p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-2">15+</div>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 text-sm">Projects Completed</p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-2">100%</div>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 text-sm">Client Satisfaction</p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-2">24h</div>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 text-sm">Avg. Response Time</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Process section -->
    <div
      class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 p-8 md:p-10 mb-16"
    >
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-8 text-center">
        How we'll work together
      </h3>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <!-- Step 1 -->
        <div class="text-center">
          <div
            class="w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500 to-orange-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 shadow-lg"
          >
            <span class="text-white font-bold text-xl">1</span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-neutral-900 mb-2">
            Discovery Call
          </h4>
          <p class="text-neutral-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We discuss your needs, timeline, and budget. I'll ask questions to
            understand your goals and propose the best approach.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2 -->
        <div class="text-center">
          <div
            class="w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-indigo-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 shadow-lg"
          >
            <span class="text-white font-bold text-xl">2</span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-neutral-900 mb-2">
            Clear Proposal
          </h4>
          <p class="text-neutral-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            You get a detailed scope, timeline, and fixed-price quote. No
            surprises, no hidden fees—just transparent pricing.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <div class="text-center">
          <div
            class="w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500 to-teal-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 shadow-lg"
          >
            <span class="text-white font-bold text-xl">3</span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-neutral-900 mb-2">
            Build & Deliver
          </h4>
          <p class="text-neutral-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            I build your project with regular updates. You review milestones,
            provide feedback, and get a polished final product.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom CTA -->
    <div
      class="bg-gradient-to-br from-neutral-900 to-neutral-800 rounded-2xl p-10 md:p-12 text-center"
    >
      <h3 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
        Let's start with a conversation
      </h3>
      <p
        class="text-xl text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto"
      >
        No pressure, no commitment. Just a friendly chat about your project and
        how I might be able to help.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-600 to-orange-600 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-orange-600/20 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
        >
          Schedule a free call
          <svg
            class="w-5 h-5"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          >
            <path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a
          href="/work"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/20 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl hover:bg-white/20 transition-all duration-200"
        >
          See my work
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
